CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_PokeManiac_1::
	.string "Let me recount a terryfing tale...\p"
	.string "Once upon a time, there was a little\n"
	.string "boy who was given a new BICYCLE...\p"
	.string "He wanted to try it right away...\p"
	.string "He was having so much fun that he\n"
	.string "didn’t notice the sun had set...\p"
	.string "While riding home in the pitch-black\n"
	.string "night, the bike suddenly slowed!\p"
	.string "The pedals became heavy!\p"
	.string "When he stopped pedaling, the bike\n"
	.string "began slipping backwards!\p"
	.string "It was as if the bike were cursed\n"
	.string "and trying to drag him into oblivion!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "...$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_PokeManiac_2::
	.string "SHRIEEEEK!\p"
	.string "The boy had been riding uphill on\n"
	.string "CYCLING ROAD!\p"
	.string "...\n"
	.string "Ba-dum ba-dum!\p"
	.string "For listening so patiently, you may\n"
	.string "take this--TM03!$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_PokeManiac_3::
	.string "TM03 is CURSE.\p"
	.string "It’s a terryfing move that slowly\n"
	.string "whittles down the victim’s HP.$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_ItemBall::
	.string "{PLAYER} obtained an EEVEE!$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_Sign1_1::
	.string "POKéMON Lecture\p"
	.string "Playing with the Wireless Adapter$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_Sign1_2::
	.string "Which heading do you want to read?$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_Sign1_3::
	.string "The POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB is\n"
	.string "upstairs at any POKéMON CENTER.\p"
	.string "Visit one to link up with friend(s)\n"
	.string "using your Wireless Adapter.$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_Sign1_4::
	.string "To link only with a friend, go to\n"
	.string "the DIRECT CORNER.\p"
	.string "It is the right counter at the\n"
	.string "POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB.\p"
	.string "Go into the TRADE CORNER or the\n"
	.string "COLOSSEUM with your friend.$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_Sign1_5::
	.string "To link and communicate with\n"
	.string "anyone, go to the UNION ROOM.\p"
	.string "It is the left counter at the\n"
	.string "POKéMON WIRELESS CLUB.\p"
	.string "Go to the UNION ROOM and enjoy\n"
	.string "meeting other TRAINERS.$"

CeladonCity_Interior8_Text_Sign3::
	.string "It’s a pamphlet on TMs.\p"
	.string "… …\p"
	.string "There are fifty TMs in all.\p"
	.string "There are also seven HMs that\n"
	.string "can be used repeatedly.\p"
	.string "SILPH CO.$"
